position: 0,0
color: blue
---
<<declare $met_envoy = false>>
<<declare $reputation_guild = 0>>
<<declare $gold = 25>>
===

title: guild_start
tags: entry
owner: claude
status: review
position: 0,200
color: blue
---
Envoy: You're late. The Guild doesn't wait. #emotion:wary
<<set $met_envoy to true>>
<<if $reputation_guild >= 3>>
    Envoy: ...though for you, I'll make an exception.
<<else>>
    Envoy: State your business or leave.
<<endif>>
-> "I came about the contract."
    <<jump ask_terms>>
-> "Here. For your trouble." <<if $gold >= 10>>
    <<set $gold to $gold - 10>>
    <<set $reputation_guild to $reputation_guild + 1>>
    <<jump ask_terms>>
-> "Not telling you."
    <<set $reputation_guild to $reputation_guild - 1>>
    Envoy: Then we're done here. #emotion:cold
    <<stop>>
===

title: ask_terms
owner: claude
status: needs-hue
position: 320,200
color: orange
---
Envoy: Half upfront, half on delivery. No exceptions.
The envoy slides a sealed ledger across the table.
// @hue: Does the ledger matter later? If it does, this is where to plant it.
-> "Deal."
    <<set $reputation_guild to $reputation_guild + 1>>
    <<jump accepted>>
-> "Too steep."
    <<jump haggle>>
===

